{"_id":"6a04dbaea4597d03c3eed93f","title":"Custom controls","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/412997846daa5174b032c24f23e93772f69f197aa68fd60bd2ba6118e86a3ae2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1778703278668.jpg"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/412997846daa5174b032c24f23e93772f69f197aa68fd60bd2ba6118e86a3ae2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1778703278668.jpg"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Custom-controls-215266","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":2956,"executes":37725,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/05df67374a7cef3618acccd2adf33f42f9ece7a6baa185cc63cf5abd93851bbf.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1778703278668.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1778703278668.jpg"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/05df67374a7cef3618acccd2adf33f42f9ece7a6baa185cc63cf5abd93851bbf.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1778703278668.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1778703278668.jpg"},"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-05-13T20:14:38.692Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-13T20:14:38.692Z","lastBump":"2026-05-13T20:14:38.692Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://Custom-Controls1.github.io/-\"))()","features":"## 🌌 Custom Mobile Control (Joystick & Jump Button)\nA custom mobile control system for Roblox. It completely replaces the standard TouchGui with a dynamic joystick and a jump button that you can customize with your own images.\n## 🚀 Features\n * **Any Image Support:** Loads files with any resolution and any name directly from the workspace folder.\n * **Auto-Search:** The script automatically finds the first image in the folder, so there is no need to configure file names.\n * **Full Synchronization:** Your image is applied instantly to the stick, its base background, and the dot trail.\n * **Accidental Tap Protection:** You can configure the joystick to trigger only on swipes, ignoring casual static screen clicks.\n * **Settings Persistence:** Your selected mode saves automatically to a text file for each specific game.\n## 🛠️ Setup Guide\nThe script will automatically create the necessary folders inside your executor's workspace. You just need to drop your images there:\n```text\nworkspace/\n├── Joystick picture/\n│   └── (Drop any image here for the joystick)\n├── Jump picture/\n│   └── (Drop any image here for the jump button)\n└── joystick ID's/\n    └── (Settings are saved here automatically)\n\n```\n> ⚠️ **Important:** Place exactly one image inside the joystick and jump folders so the script grabs the correct texture without confusion.\n> \n## 💬 Chat Commands\nConfigure your control behavior on the fly directly through the in-game text chat:\n * off — Disables the custom controls and restores the default Roblox buttons.\n * on — Re-enables the custom control system.\n * wer — Enables swipe-only mode. The joystick appears only if you drag your finger (ignores simple quick clicks). This setting is saved.\n * rew — Disables swipe-only mode. The joystick spawns instantly at the exact spot you tap. This setting is saved.","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab","username":"AquaHubs","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7e02e51bd58aebb427777683475658de8fbe58b816c2c9155eebeb4e82e055ad.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab-1786945971510.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7e02e51bd58aebb427777683475658de8fbe58b816c2c9155eebeb4e82e055ad.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab-1786945971510.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T02:28:28.222Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a04dbaea4597d03c3eed942","editBy":{"_id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab","username":"AquaHubs","status":"offline","id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-05-13T20:14:38.697Z"},{"_id":"6a04df35f0b498c086f63b69","editBy":{"_id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab","username":"AquaHubs","status":"offline","id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-05-13T20:29:41.212Z"},{"_id":"6a0a246383b5f2d84df6d9de","editBy":{"_id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab","username":"AquaHubs","status":"offline","id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab"},"message":"I made the best joystick","createdAt":"2026-05-17T20:26:11.830Z"},{"_id":"6a0a39a20bd580f7a181a30a","editBy":{"_id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab","username":"AquaHubs","status":"offline","id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-05-17T21:56:50.422Z"},{"_id":"6a10d42463854f709a633c06","editBy":{"_id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab","username":"AquaHubs","status":"offline","id":"6951e18bcccf728a17a38fab"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-05-22T22:09:40.091Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a04e58c61c5b96534759e1e","commentBy":{"_id":"67b9101842f850b2fcb99574","username":"boyrap","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8ccf3c89859490260e324f823b1fc870ddebba851886067391a3deaa9ff449a3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67b9101842f850b2fcb99574-1778858369071.png"},"createdAt":"2025-02-21T23:45:28.624Z","lastActive":"2026-10-23T19:25:53.982Z","lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"67b9101842f850b2fcb99574","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8ccf3c89859490260e324f823b1fc870ddebba851886067