":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d4a98294344628f14056f02c42429c08415c7fb7a2a7a76da0aa618713f853f6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69a25516185b83bd07b2dd2c-1772246341640.jpg"},"lastActive":"2026-10-07T21:23:53.888Z","createdAt":"2026-02-28T02:38:14.842Z","status":"offline","id":"69a25516185b83bd07b2dd2c","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d4a98294344628f14056f02c42429c08415c7fb7a2a7a76da0aa618713f853f6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69a25516185b83bd07b2dd2c-1772246341640.jpg"}},"text":"Really nice but the biggest problem I see is how if you use the Roblox mini thumbstick thing that gets forced onto you in some games, then it keeps letting you zoom your camera which makes it so walking using this script makes your camera horrible. Also this is specifically if you join a game with the mini thumbstick already selected or in a game with the mini thumbstick set by developers. The same thing happens with tap to move.","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-09-14T21:34:39.274Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]}